Subject: [PATCH] feat(transitions): spectrum curtain into Work; fold and no
 dead scroll out of the hero
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Experience→Work: replace the radio's 180° turn with a wall of equaliser
columns that rises, closes and drops centre-out onto the player (pure
seam-frame, fixed overlay, swap hidden inside a tested cover plateau).

Hero→About: cut the dead 28% tail of the camera (340→292svh, phases rescaled
to keep every phase's scroll distance) and fold the supporting lanes into the
profile lane during the landing.
